<title>CANADA: Cambior Q3 share, net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Cambior Q3 share, net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$0.05     loss     US$0.09</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 3,300     loss	 4,700</p>
<p> Revs			91,700		   64,200</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit     US$0.09   profit     US$0.02</p>
