<p> Revs		     226,400		  208,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,000			n/a</p>
<p>		(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Cambior Inc. Third quarter 1995 results reflect temporary shutdown of operations at Omai mine in Guyana.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 9941-8100</p>
